    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "SURVIVAL OBJECTIVE:\nThe building's basement doors have burst and floodwaters
    are rising rapidly!\nAscend vertically from room to room, jumping across floating
    and crumbling furniture\nto reach the rescue helicopter waiting on the rooftop.\n\nCONTROLS:\n\u2022
    W / A / S / D  or  Left Stick : Move & Swim\n\u2022 Spacebar  or  Gamepad A :
    Jump & Ascend in Water\n\nHAZARDS:\n\u2022 Breath Meter: Keep your oxygen above
    0% when submerged underwater.\n\u2022 Shark Threat: Watch out for patrolling
    sharks in flooded hallways!"
